All hardware designs, schematic files, mask layouts (GDSII/OASIS), and device 
simulation models are licensed under:
所有硬件设计图纸、原理图文件、掩膜版图（GDSII/OASIS）及器件仿真模型均遵循：

   CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)
   CERN 开放硬件许可协议第 2 版 - 强互惠型 (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)
   Full text / 官方协议全文: https://spdx.org/licenses/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.html

2. SOFTWARE & DRIVERS (软件与驱动部分):
All instruction set architecture (ISA) decoders, driver APIs, compilers, and 
runtime libraries are licensed under:
所有指令集架构（ISA）解码器、底层驱动接口、编译器以及运行时函数库均遵循：

   GNU Lesser General Public License Version 3.0 or later (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
   GNU 宽通用公共许可证第 3.0 版或更高版本 (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
   Full text / 官方协议全文: https://spdx.org/licenses/LGPL-3.0-or-later.html

3. DOCUMENTATION (文档资料部分):
All technical specifications, documentation, and papers are licensed under:
所有技术规范白皮书、说明文档及学术论文均遵循：

   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
   知识共享署名 4.0 国际许可协议 (CC-BY-4.0)
   Full text / 官方协议全文: https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-4.0.html

